("Open CakeVPN to install it.", "Ouvrez CakeVPN pour l'installer.", "Abre CakeVPN para instalarla.", "Apri CakeVPN per installarlo.", "Öffne CakeVPN, um es zu installieren.", "설치하려면 CakeVPN을 여세요."),
